"version\";N;s:11:\"auto_update\";N;s:4:\"info\";O:14:\"FS_Plugin_Info\":13:{s:2:\"id\";s:4:\"4608\";s:7:\"updated\";s:19:\"2026-06-02 09:01:18\";s:7:\"created\";s:19:\"2024-12-05 13:12:19\";s:22:\"\0FS_Entity\0_is_updated\";b:0;s:9:\"plugin_id\";s:5:\"16922\";s:11:\"description\";s:1650:\"<h2>Unlock the Full Potential of Your Shop with FSL Discount Add-On</h2>\n<p>The <b>FSL Discount Add-On</b> is your ultimate tool for increasing sales and creating an engaging shopping experience. By adding strategic spending goals with automatic discounts or coupon-based rewards, this add-on drives more revenue and enhances customer satisfaction. It works seamlessly with <b>Free Shipping</b> and <b>Free Gift</b> offers, making it a must-have for any store owner.</p>\n\n<h3>1. Boost Revenue with Multi-Step Discounts</h3>\n<p>Motivate customers to spend more by introducing single, double, or triple-step thresholds in your progress bar. Whether it’s working toward free shipping, a free gift, or exclusive discounts, the add-on keeps customers engaged and inspires action—especially when they’re close to achieving their next reward. This leads to higher average order values and smoother checkouts.</p>\n\n<h3>2. Enhance the Shopping Experience</h3>\n<p>With a visually dynamic progress bar that updates in real-time, customers can see exactly how close they are to earning rewards. This transparency builds excitement and urgency, increasing the likelihood of completing purchases while fostering a sense of achievement and loyalty.</p>\n\n<h3>3. Automate Incentives for Maximum Efficiency</h3>\n<p>The FSL Discount Add-On saves you time by automating discounts and coupons. Choose between percentage discounts that apply automatically at checkout or custom coupon codes to reward your customers. This flexibility ensures the add-on integrates seamlessly with your store’s promotional strategy while keeping operations simple and efficient.</p>\";s:17:\"short_description\";s:128:\"Motivate customers to spend more with a dynamic progress bar that unlocks exclusive discounts or coupons, boosting your revenue!\";s:10:\"banner_url\";s:68:\"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/freemius/plugins/16922/banner.png\";s:15:\"card_banner_url\";s:73:\"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/freemius/plugins/16922/card_banner.png\";s:15:\"selling_point_0\";s:72:\"Boosts revenue by motivating customers to spend more to unlock discounts\";s:15:\"selling_point_1\";s:96:\"Encourages higher cart values with clear progress tracking toward exclusive percentage discounts\";s:15:\"selling_point_2\";s:88:\"Drives engagement and repeat purchases by making discounts feel rewarding and achievable\";s:11:\"screenshots\";O:8:\"stdClass\":4:{s:12:\"screenshot_0\";s:75:\"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/freemius/plugins/16922/screenshots/0.png\";s:12:\"screenshot_1\";s:75:\"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/freemius/plugins/16922/screenshots/1.png\";s:12:\"screenshot_2\";s:75:\"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/freemius/plugins/16922/screenshots/2.png\";s:12:\"screenshot_3\";s:75:\"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/freemius/plugins/16922/screenshots/3.png\";}}s:10:\"is_premium\";b:0;s:14:\"premium_suffix\";s:9:\"(Premium)\";s:7:\"is_live\";b:1;s:9:\"bundle_id\";N;s:17:\"bundle_public_key\";N;s:17:\"opt_in_moderation\";N;}}}s:13:\"admin_notices\";a:1:{s:19:\"free-shipping-label\";a:0:{}}}','auto');
